{
  "name": "matrixmedia-mcp",
  "version": "0.3.0",
  "description": "MCP server for MatrixMedia (矩媒) — publish videos to 抖音/快手/视频号/小红书/B站/百家号/头条/番茄视频 from any MCP client. Requires the MatrixMedia desktop app.",
